.TH PERVIUS-PROOF 1 "2026-11-18" "Pervius" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pervius\-proof \- live NetworkManager/OpenVPN connection test
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pervius\-proof
.BI \-\-location " CITY"
.RB [ \-\-proto " udp|tcp]"
.RB [ \-\-refresh ]
.RB [ \-\-timeout
.IR SECONDS ]
.RB [ \-\-delete\-profile ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates or updates the Pervius-managed NetworkManager profile for the chosen
location and brings up a real VPN connection, then waits for Enter to
disconnect. It changes NetworkManager settings; run it only when you intend
to. Close the desktop application first.
.PP
The username and password are prompted for locally. A password is never
accepted as an argument, environment variable or file, and is never printed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-location " CITY"
City or COUNTRY/City to connect to.
.TP
.BR \-\-proto " udp|tcp"
Transport (default udp).
.TP
.B \-\-refresh
Download a fresh catalogue first.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECONDS"
Connection timeout (default 90).
.TP
.B \-\-delete\-profile
Offer to delete the managed profile afterwards.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pervius (1)
